{"pageProps":{"story":{"name":"UX-Strategie & Beratung","created_at":"2024-08-02T13:03:06.223Z","published_at":"2025-07-23T13:03:53.042Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T13:03:53.056Z","id":531663343,"uuid":"870d7600-cee2-4894-806b-d0de5074f587","content":{"seo":{"_uid":"c749fe71-fea5-4b03-af9f-42e8806d3224","type":"seo","image":{"id":17280410,"alt":"","name":"","focus":"","title":"","source":"","filename":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/880x462/569bedee69/rm_ux-beratung.png","copyright":"","fieldtype":"asset","meta_data":{},"is_external_url":false},"title":"User Experience Strategie und UX-Beratung","keywords":"UX, UX-Design, UX-Strategie, UX-Beratunbg, UX-Research, User Research, Holistic UX, Change, UX-Management, User Experience","cardImage":"","component":"seo","description":"Wir begleiten Teams bei dem Change  in eine kunden- und nutzerzentrierte Produktorganisation."},"_uid":"da17f642-6001-4a1b-a27f-6de1536b2468","type":"page","section":[{"_uid":"882633c6-3d64-4e0e-9355-12d7af38919a","type":"section","style":"","width":"full","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"Wir begleiten Teams bei dem Change in eine kunden- und nutzerzentrierte Produktorganisation.","_uid":"b6c856b3-537d-417a-948e-ebe57c3b4154","text":"","type":"hero","height":"fullImage","buttons":[{"_uid":"b069dd24-7fce-489e-a550-ab15f75a21a2","icon":"arrow-down","type":"buttons","label":"Weiterlesen","target":"ux-strategie-beratung#user-experience","component":"buttons"}],"overlay":false,"textbox":true,"headline":"UX ist mehr als nur Design","component":"hero","image_alt":"Sehr komponiertes Foto eines Schreibtisches mit verschiedenen Büroutensielien, alles drapiert rund um das Buch \"Change by Design\" von Tim Brown","colorNeutral":false,"image_indent":"none","textPosition":"left","highlightText":true,"image_srcMobile":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/464x265/ed49bd68c0/rm_rm-hero_ux_mobile.jpg","image_srcTablet":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1024x585/39f3db1ba2/rm_rm-hero_ux_tablet.jpg","image_srcDesktop":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1920x1100/8191565c3a/rm_rm-hero_ux_dkt.jpg"}],"spaceAfter":"none","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"ded125ad-f462-477b-b93e-b51d2c734d0e","type":"section","style":"horizontalGradient","width":"default","buttons":[],"inverted":true,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"9691ec2b-7013-4433-a0c7-60817c269cb0","text":"## User Experience\nDas gesamtheitliche Erlebnis als wirtschaftlicher Erfolgsfaktor. Wir unterstützen Startups und KMUs bei der nutzerzentrierten Produktentwicklung und der Einführung von UX-Methoden, wie User Research und Usability Tests.\n\n### Entscheidungen forschungs- und datenbasiert treffen\nMit der richtigen Herangehensweise und UX Strategie wird Ihr Produkt zu einem echten Asset mit messbarem Erfolg. Design ist heutzutage ein interdisziplinärer und ganzheitlicher Prozess. Viele Tools helfen Unternehmen frühzeitig und kontinuierlich zu erfahren, ob die Ideen und Produkte, die entwickelt werden, auch wirklich die Bedürfnisse Ihrer Kunden und Nutzer befriedigen.","type":"text","align":"left","layout":"singleColumn","component":"text","highlightText":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"UX-Strategie und Beratung","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"left","headline_large":true,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"9720fc59-cca9-452d-9f8f-4accc702cafe","type":"section","style":"","width":"default","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"Echtes Nutzerfeedback","_uid":"dee62c62-7028-417a-a54d-727cf5279fc2","text":"Nie war es so einfach, Ihre Nutzer und Kunden in den gesamten Entwicklungsprozess einzubinden. Stete UX Research unterstützt Sie dabei die Anforderungen, Bedürfnisse und Probleme Ihrer Zielgruppe kennenzulernen. Diese Erkenntnisse helfen, die richtigen Produktentscheidungen zu treffen und Kosten zu sparen.","type":"image-story","layout":"textLeft","buttons":[],"padding":false,"headline":"User Research","component":"image-story","image_alt":"Detailfoto von einigen Post-Its aus einem Workshop auf einem Filzboard","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/3000x2000/207c3cf573/patrick-perkins-etrpjvb0km0-unsplash.jpg","textAlign":"left","image_vAlign":"top","largeHeadline":false,"image_aspectRatio":""}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"3c3197d6-c700-4e13-986b-d5066e335535","type":"section","style":"","width":"default","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"Gestaltung digitaler Nutzererlebnisse","_uid":"0ded4dba-295a-4933-a50b-eb27f8be5630","text":"Nie war es so einfach, Ihre Nutzer und Kunden in den gesamten Entwicklungsprozess einzubinden. Stete UX Research unterstützt Sie dabei die Anforderungen, Bedürfnisse und Probleme Ihrer Zielgruppe kennenzulernen. Diese Erkenntnisse helfen, die richtigen Produktentscheidungen zu treffen und Kosten zu sparen.","type":"image-story","layout":"imageLeft","buttons":[],"padding":false,"headline":"UX-Design","component":"image-story","image_alt":"Mann, der Pos.Its an eine weiße Wand klebt","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/600x400/49fabe27f8/leon-8wh1njfthay-unsplash.jpg","textAlign":"left","image_vAlign":"top","largeHeadline":false,"image_aspectRatio":"none"}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"small","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"b38c24fd-1e6e-4ea6-bbc7-6b55c0f31afd","type":"section","style":"","width":"default","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"Die unternehmenseigene UX-Kultur reifen lassen","_uid":"7839542f-1beb-428e-b378-ad8ac4e2b03c","text":"Unternehmen mit einer konsequenten Nutzerzentrierung sind erfolgreicher. Nachhaltig UX zu denken und zu praktizieren ist dennoch für die meisten Unternehmen ein Change-Prozess. Wir unterstützen Sie dabei, UX schlank und kosteneffizient einzuführen. Dabei setzen wir auf Partizipation und Hands-On-Mentalität.","type":"image-story","layout":"textLeft","buttons":[],"padding":false,"headline":"UX-Strategie und UX-Beratung","component":"image-story","image_alt":"Schmuckfoto eines kleinen Blumentopfes mit Pflänzchen, daneben ein Buchstaben Steckbild mit dem Satz auf Englisch \"Difficult Roads lead to beautiful destinations\"","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/328x400/22184c17cc/hello-i-m-nik-z1d-lp8sjui-unsplash.jpg","textAlign":"left","image_vAlign":"top","largeHeadline":false,"image_aspectRatio":"none"}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"small","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"025b6ec0-f7d0-4b07-b688-f53ab7e95030","type":"section","style":"horizontalGradient","width":"default","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"87d2862e-d216-4709-be54-1207a3ea4705","component":"global_reference","reference":[{"_uid":"fc951953-886e-433c-83ef-5813159af9ec","global":[{"sub":"Willst du ein Design System aufbauen? Oder deine Webseite relaunchen?","_uid":"0276a38a-ba42-42f2-8cb1-2c2372901f6b","text":"Unser Termin-Tool zeigt dir unsere aktuellen Verfügbarkeiten. Wähle einfach einen passenden Termin und eine Zeit aus, und schon können wir besprechen, wie wir euch unterstützen können. Oder, du schreibst uns ganz klassisch eine Email.","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[{"_uid":"cba7ab1a-a998-46af-89c9-535b0a7dc13a","icon":"date","type":"buttons","label":"Zur Terminbuchung","target":"https://app.lemcal.com/@daniel-ley","component":"buttons"},{"_uid":"23a82850-d8ad-43c6-bbee-2ae5b70dc002","icon":"email","type":"buttons","label":"Email an uns","target":"mailto:mail@ruhmesmeile.com?subject=Projektanfrage","component":"buttons"}],"headline":"Vereinbare einen kostenlosen Beratungstermin","component":"cta","fullWidth":false,"image_alt":"","textAlign":"center","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":false,"image_padding":false,"backgroundColor":"","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":false}],"component":"global","slug":"global/global-cta"}]}],"spaceAfter":"none","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"343e5e58-f1f9-41b1-95b8-3eaf6ef8f70b","type":"section","style":"","width":"default","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"Lego® für User Interfaces","_uid":"47a7c817-d37b-443a-ac59-300e3eaeaf0b","text":"Wir setzen schon frühzeitig auf die Nutzung von schlanken Design Komponenten und Tokens um schnelle Ergebnisse zu erzielen. so leichtgewichtig wie möglich. So entsteht mit jedem Schritt und Prototyp Stück für Stück eine Pattern Library, die zu einem umfassenden Digitalen Design System wachsen kann.  \nSo erreichen Sie die maximale Konsistenz über alle Ihre digitalen Touchpoints hinweg.","type":"image-story","layout":"imageLeft","buttons":[],"padding":false,"headline":"Digitale Design Systeme","component":"image-story","image_alt":"","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/600x400/cb016c5aed/markus-spiske-3dw6ie9x3q0-unsplash_600x400.jpg","textAlign":"left","image_vAlign":"top","largeHeadline":false,"image_aspectRatio":"unset"}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"9a340ccb-208f-4d88-bb7f-f6936696888a","type":"section","style":"","width":"default","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"UX-Designs lebendig werden lassen","_uid":"c6c685c3-dd2b-4232-9441-faf85223274e","text":"Unsere Frontend-Komponenten bilden die Basis für die Qualität Ihres Frontends und schlanke Prozesse. Sie beruhen auf Best Practices, sowohl technisch als auch gestalterisch und beinhalten bereits viele Content-relevante Komponenten für Websites (von Teaserelementen über News-Darstellungen bis zu bis Produktkatalogen). Gepackt in eine start-of-the-art Development Toolchain für die entsprechende Developer Experience (DX).","type":"image-story","layout":"textLeft","buttons":[],"padding":false,"headline":"Frontend & Integration","component":"image-story","image_alt":"Screenshot des kickstartDS Storybooks","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/715x400/77538c899b/screenshot_2021-09-17_at_13-08-59.png","textAlign":"left","image_vAlign":"top","largeHeadline":false,"image_aspectRatio":"unset"}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"small","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"4fd762cc-0e68-4b62-b2bb-fa6796c0c06e","type":"section","style":"","width":"default","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"UX- & Designsystem-Experte mit Leib & Seele","_uid":"ed070c94-260a-40d6-9338-e628c6492b9d","text":"**Daniel Ley** ist UX-Berater und leitet die ruhmesmeile. Mehr als **20 Jahre Erfahrung** rund um UX und Design machen ihn zum idealen Ansprechpartner für Ihr Projekt.\n\nEr ist aktives Mitglied in der German UPA, der Berufsverband für User Experience und Usability Professionals und unterstützt den diesen z.B. bei Netzwerks- und Podiumsdiskussionen oder Podcasts. Darüberhinaus organisiert er seit 2013 das [UX Meetup Bonn](https://uxbn.de/).","type":"image-story","layout":"imageLeft","buttons":[{"_uid":"af83a4e1-ce01-4757-ab6b-8b5ee8426971","icon":"arrow-right","type":"buttons","label":"Kontakt aufnehmen","target":"ueber-uns/kontakt","component":"buttons"}],"padding":false,"headline":"Engagement für UX","component":"image-story","image_alt":"Portraitfoto von Daniel Ley","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1000x667/dc09a74752/daniel-ley.png","textAlign":"left","image_vAlign":"top","largeHeadline":false,"image_aspectRatio":"unset"}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"We can create something shining for you too!","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"center","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"bold","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":""},{"_uid":"baa72637-3807-47f0-b1bc-509c4fc334d0","type":"section","style":"","width":"default","buttons":[],"inverted":true,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"58cf128b-5ca1-4b1b-8e9f-ecc8af0673aa","text":"Alle Fotos bezogen über  Unsplash. Cover von [Krisztian Tabori](https://unsplash.com/fr/@ktabori?utm_source=unsplash&utm_medium=referral&utm_content=creditCopyText) auf [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com/de/fotos/change-by-design-by-tim-brown-book-beside-smartphone-IyaNci0CyRk)\n\n--- ","type":"text","align":"left","layout":"singleColumn","component":"text","highlightText":false}],"spaceAfter":"none","spaceBefore":"small","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"left","content_width":"wide","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"none","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"largest","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false}],"component":"page","footer_inverted":false,"header_floating":false,"header_inverted":false},"slug":"ux-strategie-beratung","full_slug":"ux-strategie-beratung","sort_by_date":null,"position":120,"tag_list":[],"is_startpage":false,"parent_id":0,"meta_data":null,"group_id":"611431f2-71af-478b-90fe-1f95e1191619","first_published_at":"2024-08-05T09:13:46.585Z","release_id":null,"lang":"default","path":null,"alternates":[],"default_full_slug":null,"translated_slugs":null},"cv":1788179594,"rels":[{"name":"Global CTA","created_at":"